OL,3,GNEWSADementia patients dance into
OL,4,ABuckingham Palace
OL,5,
OL,6,FBuckingham Palace has hosted a special
OL,7,Fseries of dance workshops for people
OL,8,Fliving with dementia.
OL,10,FThe programme has been organised by
OL,11,FRoyal Collection Trust and the charity
OL,12,FArts for Dementia, with sessions
OL,13,Fdesigned and delivered by English
OL,14,FNational Ballet (ENB).
OL,16,FDirector of engagement at ENB, Fleur
OL,17,FDerbyshire-Fox said dance was not only
OL,18,Fabout cognitive benefits "but also
OL,19,Fabout the physical, emotional and
OL,20,Fsocial benefit".
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
