OL,3,GNEWSADementia patients dance into
OL,4,ABuckingham Palace
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Being in Buckingham Palace has such
OL,7,Fresonance for the people who come to
OL,8,Fthese classes. It's a rich tapestry -
OL,9,Flooking at the royal collections and
OL,10,Fbeing in this space. It's really
OL,11,Finspiring for the participants."
